# 6. Market Performance

## 6.1 Sales and Profitability by Market

| Market |    Sales |   Profit | Profit Margin | Sales Contribution |
| ------ | -------: | -------: | ------------: | -----------------: |
| APAC   |   $2.00M | $437.58K |        21.85% |             25.54% |
