# 11. Discount Impact by Category

The negative effect of high discounts is visible across all three product categories.

### Furniture

Furniture maintains a strong margin at 0% discount (**43.16%**) but becomes increasingly loss-making at higher discount levels.

At discounts above 20%, profitability becomes negative.

### Office Supplies

Office Supplies also shows a strong margin at 0% discount (**33.90%**), but profitability declines significantly as discounts increase.

### Technology

Technology has the strongest profitability at low discount levels, with a **49.50% margin at 0% discount**.

However, profitability also becomes negative at higher discount levels.

### Business Interpretation

The discount-profitability relationship is not limited to one category.

This suggests that discount governance should be applied across the business, while allowing category-specific thresholds based on product economics.

